\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S Cutscenes - Act 2\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Amber\cell What's the matter, dearie? Can't you sleep? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell No, Mum... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell You're still upset about your little fight with Gemma, eh? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell She started it! She hit me for no reason! All I did was draw eyebrows on Sandy! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Hm hm! Ha ha ha ha ha! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell ...Oi, don't laugh! Look at this great big lump she's given me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell I see it. And I saw the one on her head too. You gave her that, didn't you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell ...Yeah. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Now you listen to me, my lad\emdash there'll be plenty of times in your life when people upset you and you feel like lashing out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell But no matter how much it hurts, and no matter how much you want to hurt them back, you don't go looking for revenge. You do what's right. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell I... I want to be friends with Gemma again, Mum. What should I do? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Why, you talk to her of course, you big silly! Ask her what she was feeling, and why she did what she did. Try to see things from her point of view.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Once you've done that, the rest is easy. You just smile, and hold out your hand. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell That's my boy. ...Now, time for bed. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl <pc>\cell Night-night, Mum. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Night-night, son. Don't you worry about a thing now. It'll all be alright in the morning. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Goodnight, sleep tight, child of Yggdrasil, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
The sun, it is sleeping and the night is still... \f2\u9834?\f1  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell The stars, they watch over you with twinkling eyes, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
To ward off the darkness till dawn arrives... \f2\u9834?\f1  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell ...Have you found him yet? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Not yet, Master.\par
\par
Our forces have scoured the four corners of the world,\par
\par
but the Luminary is nowhere to be found. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell He is dead, then? Good. If that is the case... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Then this world is mine! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! You're awake! You're alert! You're alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your breath was getting shorter\emdash you couldn't breathe the water\emdash but look at you now! It's an unequivocal miracle! Queen Marinaaa! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell ...You say our guest has finally recovered from his wounds? Then let us expedite the plan\emdash it must be done, and soon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Ngh! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Majesty! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Don't fear for me, I'm not done yet. Until my work is finished, I'll find the strength to carry on\emdash I shall not be diminished. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Ah, there you are old friend\emdash hee hee!\emdash or should I say new fish! You make a finer flounder than I'd ever dared to wish!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell When first my subjects brought you here it gave me such a shock, to see you bruised and broken like a ship wrecked on the rocks.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell The Lord of Shadows thinks you dead\emdash the sea swarms with his spies. I changed you to this fishy form to hide you from his eyes.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Many troubled months have come and gone since your arrival. As you slept, my healers strove to safeguard your survival.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell You cannot know how glad I am to see you fully healed. But soon the spell will fade, and you must once more take the field.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I have a plan to see you safe\emdash that's all I've ever wished. If all goes well, you'll soon know what it feels like to be fished! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Forgive my haste, these strange events must take you by surprise. You have so many questions, I can see it in your eyes.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I saw you battle bravely by the World Tree's holy heart. I saw the Lord of Shadows tear your fellowship apart... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I saw you strive to fell the fiend, and how your plans were vexed. When you are ready, follow me\emdash to see what happened next. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell An aeon's passed since last I brought a human to this cave. It is the private parlour of the Queen Beneath the Waves. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Behold the Pearl of Wisdom\emdash jewel of we, the ocean's daughters. It lets its bearer view the world through any drop of water. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I've summoned up a thunderstorm to saturate the ground. Now, let's ascend into the rain and take a look around. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Whenever you are ready, touch your fin against the pearl, and you shall see what's come to pass there in your airy world. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell The once fair land of Erdrea is now a ravaged shell. When Mordegon destroyed its heart, the holy World Tree fell. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Upon its fall, the world was with a searing storm despoiled. Trees and grasses burned to ashes, lakes and rivers boiled.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Burning boulders fell to earth and pulverised the land. Mountains cracked and realms were racked at his unholy hand.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell In one fell swoop, the Lord of Shadows ended countless lives. The lucky few who rode the storm out struggle to survive.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Their days are filled with desperation, misery and tears. I see them quake and tremble, but I cannot calm their fears... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please...help...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Somebody... Please... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is... Is someone there...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please...help me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our homes are gone\emdash our families and friends too. All we have left is our lives. We can't just sit down and die. We have to keep walking! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have to keep following the Hero! They say he's built a fortress south of Heliodor\emdash if we can make our way there, we'll be safe. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't give up, okay? This Hero guy won't let us down. Once we get to the Last Bastion, everything'll be fine\emdash you'll see! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A few more short steps\par
\par
Lead from darkness into dawn.\par
\par
Safe haven awaits! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Amid the black depths of despair, a spark of light still shines\emdash a man who gives the people hope in these benighted times.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Yet that light too shall soon succumb to evil's ceaseless claim. Only you can take that spark and kindle it to flame... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Yggdrasil has crashed to earth, Her light has disappeared. In Her place, the Lord of Shadows' citadel of fear.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell He took the sacred World Tree's power and now makes it his own. Foul Mordegon commands the world from his unholy throne.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell His forces seek to steal the souls of every last survivor. His flying servants sweep the skies, the seas swarm with his divers... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Alizarin\emdash the fiend that seeks to devastate my nation. Another one of Mordegon's detestable creations.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I've cast a spell to hold him back, but need it to be stronger\emdash the barrier's at breaking point, and cannot last much longer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I'd hoped that I could save my realm\emdash it was a foolish notion. Compared to his, my strength is but a raindrop in the ocean.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Ere long, the barrier will fall, and Nautica will too. Marauding beasts may take my life...but they shall not take you. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell ...Our time grows short. I fear my kingdom's race is nearly run. My place is with my subjects now\emdash we face our fate as one. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell How curious you are, my friend. I showed you fearful sights, and yet those wide and watery eyes still gleam with limpid light.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell It seems that grief and tragedy have followed you since birth. Cruel fate's dark plan has stalked you to the corners of the earth.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell And yet you've weathered every blow, prevailed against all strife. You've brushed with death a thousand times, yet still you have your life!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell It is the will of Yggdrasil that you are still alive. It is your fate to save this world\emdash for this, you must survive. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Bright Luminary, let the light shine on the world again! Find the fading sparks of hope and kindle them to flame!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell You'll find the sparks I speak of here and there throughout the land\emdash they are the former members of your staunch and stalwart band.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell The fire within their hearts will light the path that you must tread\emdash find your friends and bring an end to this dark age of dread!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell While the Luminary lives, there's hope for people still. You cannot fail, you must prevail\emdash it is the World Tree's will. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Beware! The barrier shakes and breaks! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell The Lord of Shadows' followers give fond farewells short shrift. I had so much to tell you, but it seems I must be swift. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Do not lose heart! Do not look back! Until your time is through... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell ...Remember, you're the Luminary\emdash we believe in you! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Citizens of Nautica!\par
\par
Give your lives to the Lord of Shadows! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hoo! Blue John's hooked himself a biggun! Could it be the legendary man-eating mackerel!? Let's reel him in and find out! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Yesss! I caught something! I actually caught something! Blue John's going to eat tonight!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Heh! Maybe there is some good in this forsaken world after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell ...... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Wh-Wh-Who the heck are you!? And what were you doing on the end of my hook!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell I don't care how hungry you are\emdash you don't go pinching the bait off another man's line! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Hey, now... Don't cry, sonny... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Look, I don't know what's got you sniffling, but it must be something serious.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell So listen\emdash Blue John's going to help you out! We fisher folk've gotta look after each other, ain't we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell You can stay the night at my hut. There's none too many safe places left in this rotten world, but it'll do you for a day or two.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell When you're ready, you can head over to the Last Bastion\emdash they'll see you right. The feller running the place is a boney-fido hero! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Right, now that's decided, let's head for shore! Hold on tight, lad\emdash things are about to get choppy! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Ahoy there, sonny! So you finally roused yourself from your slumbers, eh? Blue John'd say good morning, but there ain't no morning to speak of these days.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell You hadn't noticed? Why, we've seen nothing but dark sky since the day of the disaster. Ahh, just look at the state of it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell There was an almighty booming and rumbling, and then great gouts of blackness started billowing up from the castle over in Heliodor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Since then, nothing's been right. That was the last time any of us saw the sun.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell That ain't good! We'd better hide, and fast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell ...That was a close one! Them monsters started pouring out of Heliodor Castle about the same time as the blackness. The rotters seem to think they own the place!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell They've never come so near before, though. They'll be lookin' for food, I'll warrant. An' there Blue John was thinking he'd found himself a safe spot...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Listen\emdash seems the vittles round these parts are set to get mighty scarce. I hate to send you packing sonny, but I reckon you'd best be on your way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell You'll be safer over at the Last Bastion anyhow. Go on and get yourself over there before the monsters spot you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell That Hero feller'll look after you, I'm sure. He's a good 'un, that one\emdash a spark of hope in these dark old times.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Blue John\cell Steer a course due west until you hit Cobblestone Falls. The Last Bastion lies just beyond. Mind how you go now, sonny!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Sandy! There you are! And where did you run off to, might I ask?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Sandy\cell Woof woof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Oh my\emdash ! It's... It's really you, isn't it...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Y-You're alive...! And you've... You've come back to us...! Oh, I've been so, so, so worried, especially after... Well, we heard such awful things...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Sandy\cell (whine)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell (sniff) Oh, Sandy! You're right, of course! This is the best news I could have hoped for, and here I am blubbering like a baby!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Welcome home!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Sandy\cell Woof! Woof woof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell It's not quite the Cobblestone we grew up in, is it? No, we've been through a lot... After you left, this terrible man named Jasper came...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I, I'll never forget his eyes\emdash they were so cold... H-He rounded us all up in the centre of the village...and then he ordered his men to kill us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell But we were lucky. Not everyone is as cruel as Jasper. No, another soldier came and told him to stop. He said there was no need to take our lives.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell But that didn't stop them burning the village to the ground and locking us all up in the castle... Still, that one good man made sure we came to no harm.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Sandy\cell Woof! Woof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Sorry, Sandy! You're right\emdash he's just got home after a long journey. He doesn't want to hear me blathering on!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Come on, let's go and see the one person who'll be even happier to see you than me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Come on, girls! Put your backs into it! The boys are out there doing the fighting, so it's up to us to keep the home fires burning!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell S-Sorry to interrupt Amber, but...I've got big news!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Hello, Gemma love. What's got you so excited, hm?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Well, you're not going to believe this, but...there's someone very special here to see you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell ...My little soldier!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell (sniff) I, I just can't believe it's you! After all the awful things that happened, I was sure you were... Sure you were... (sob)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell When the disaster struck, so many people lost their lives... The sun vanished, and those terrible monsters appeared all over the place...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Even those of us who were lucky enough to survive were so drained and desperate that we almost lost the will to live...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell And then the Hero appeared, just when we needed him! He did all he could to help people, no matter who they were or where they were from.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell He fought off the monsters and brought everyone here to safety. Without him, I dread to think what would have become of us...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell And now, thanks to him, the place you once knew as Cobblestone has become the Last Bastion\emdash humanity's safe haven in a world beset by darkness!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Would you believe we've even got the King of Heliodor camped out here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Look, I know he was the one who ordered the village to be burned, but I'm sure he had his reasons. Things aren't always as they seem, love.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell He may be the last person you want to see, but you should go and talk things through with the King. Your grandfather would have wanted you to at least try.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Just pop your head round the door of his tent, will you, love? For me? It's the one in the middle of the camp with the two flags. And be polite!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell So. You are alive and well, I see.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell You have nothing to fear. I have regained my senses at last. The living nightmare that began for me on the day of your birth has ended.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Though in truth, I remember little of what I did... I have inflicted so much pain on so many... On you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell I do not ask for forgiveness\emdash I do not deserve it. All I ask is that I be allowed to atone. To pay for my crimes by protecting those who remain.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Tell me\emdash do you recall what happened on that fateful day? The events that came to pass beneath Yggdrasil's branches?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell I see... I recall nothing. All I know is that whomever\emdash or whatever\emdash had me in its grasp for all those years left me there...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell And when at long last I returned to my senses, I was here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell There is something else I must ask you... Tell me...do you know if my daughter is alive?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell ...I see.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Majesty!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Hero has returned! He brings more survivors seeking sanctuary!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Come, you must meet he to whom we owe our survival. Though you may not wish to at first...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Hm. The Luminary lives.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Welcome back, Hendrik. Well? What news?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The forces of darkness amass at the gates of Heliodor. They will strike, and soon. Sire, the people must be removed to safety.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Men! All the signs are that our enemy will strike tonight! To arms! They shall not find us unprepared!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell As you see, he is as...eloquent as ever. But you must forgive him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell He has fought harder than any of us. He has sacrificed more than anyone. ...Which is why his burden must be lightened.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell It is time that your differences were set aside, Luminary. Mankind needs you. Hendrik needs you. Will you stand beside him?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell I can well understand the ill will you feel. But there is no other save yourself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Good. If we are able to withstand the assault tonight, we may yet survive. Join the troops outside the fortress when you are ready.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! You must be our newest recruit! They say you made it all the way to the Last Bastion under your own steam! Well, I'm impressed, I've got to tell you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You can obviously handle yourself\emdash that or you were born lucky!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, either way, I'm sure we can find a use for you. Follow me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, here's your spot. Just face that way, and when the monsters come, stick the pointy end of your sword in them. Don't look so worried! You'll be fiiine!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Enemy forces! Here they come!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Positions, men!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Chaaarge!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Raaaaaah!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Behind you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grrruuurrrgh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Never let down your guard.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell You will need to pull your weight if we are to escape this one. Have at them!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our beloved commander, brightest and best of the Spectral Sentinels, spake truly when he spake of thee, Hendrik. Thou art without a shred of guile! Any other would have fled the field long ago!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I have no complaints. Our reward for tearing thee limb from limb shall be a handsome one indeed! GREH HEH HEH HEHHH!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, fools? Wherefore gapest ye like ninnies?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: KILL HIIIM!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: GRAAAAAARRRGH!!!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: R-R-Retreat! Move your bones!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Commander! A message from His Majesty! He wishes to speak with you\emdash both of you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Right away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell It seems we owe you both a debt of gratitude.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
