\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Obsidian. Thank the heavens I have one truly faithful friend...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The darkness may have dissipated, but we cannot know what toll the battle took.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell We must return to the Last Bastion and see what...if anything...remains.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Someone! Anyone! Your Majesty!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Please...somebody!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Wait! That noise...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Sandy\cell Woof! Woof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell O come, raise your voices in song! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
We thought days of sunshine were gone, \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
But ohhh, happy day, gladly we see we were wrong! \f2\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell So come, sing of joy and of light! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
Of what's true, what's good and what's right! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
We'll siiing! Sing until morning's first light! \f2\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Yes, sing, men of Heliodor! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
It's morning, say goodbye to war! \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
Now siiing! Sing till you can sing no more! \f2\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell You did it, Hendrik. You saved us all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Out of my way! Let me through!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Let me look at you in daylight at last! Oh, yes! My handsome little soldier! My hero, just look at you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell You set aside your differences with Hendrik...with me...and fought to bring back the light. We are forever in your debt.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell The world is still in a desperate state. But now we have something\emdash we have hope. We have the Luminary. May you banish the darkness once and for all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Hendrik...my ever-faithful knight. Today's victory is as much yours as anyone's.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Your strength too will be needed in the struggle to free the world from evil. You know what you must do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell The people of the Last Bastion will learn to make do without you\emdash as, I hope, will I. Hm hm!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell So please\emdash do not hesitate. Do what you know you must.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Honoured Luminary...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I serve you now. Though it cost me my life, I will stand beside you until the darkness is no more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Hendrik and <pc> join forces!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Dawn breaks in Heliodor! The first victory in the fight against the darkness is ours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell The celebrations at the Last Bastion continue long into the night, and the sound of joyous song echoes through the valleys.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Then, morning comes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell I trust that you slept well? Or did the people perhaps not permit you the luxury of rest, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Ha! Even better! There is no surer sign of a kingdom at peace than a high-spirited populace!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Now, to more serious matters. Hendrik, there is something I wish you to have.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Th-The Shield of Heliodor! B-But, sire!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell You are like a son to me. And it is a father's duty to prepare his offspring for the dangers that await them. You will have need of it, I am sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell You wear it well. The Shield has always been the mark of our mightiest knights. There can be none mightier than the Luminary's own guardian.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell You have no complaints, I trust?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell No, my liege!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell I understand that you had hoped for the World Tree to guide you on your quest. Alas, it is no more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell But all hope is not lost. Your father once told me that Yggdrasil was not the only sacred place in Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell He spoke of another\emdash a holy mountain in the south known as Pang Lai.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell The fate of those who dwell there is deeply intertwined with that of the Luminary, or so he said.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell It may be mere hearsay\emdash a conversation half-remembered\emdash but if it is true, you may yet find help in your quest to defeat the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Venture west through the Manglegrove, and you will find a valley that leads to the Costa Valor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell Pass through the checkpoint beyond it, and you will soon find Mount Pang Lai.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl King Carnelian\cell It is not a road I have travelled myself. Be prepared. And may your journey be a safe one.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell A temple on top of a mountain... What connection could a place like this have to the Luminary?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It certainly benefits from divine protection of some kind\emdash Yggdrasil fell to earth not far from here, yet the temple buildings escaped entirely unscathed. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...I know that face! That man is a knight of Heliodor! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heliodorian swine! You think that your blockade will break us? Think again! The disciples of Angri-La are made of sterner stuff\emdash as you will soon see! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell What in the\emdash !? These movements must be intended to confound us. Be on your guard\emdash they may attack from any angle! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Enough, all of you! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is this how we treat visitors? As your High Lama, I order you to stand down! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your Holiness, these people are not visitors\emdash they are soldiers of Heliodor! We cannot be sure of their intentions! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Soldiers of Heliodor, you say?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The tall one, perhaps...but his young friend does not look like a military man to me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I sense a great power within you! Tell me, young man\emdash are you the Luminary? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Do not try to hide it. The strength of your soul radiates from every chakra! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Incredible... He divined your true identity with a single glance... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell How long we have waited for this day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Please, you must forgive my disciples' discourtesy. Their training is...incomplete.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Welcome to Angri-La, honoured Luminary. It would please me if you would join me in the High Hall at the top of the temple. We have much to discuss. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell A strange child. But remarkably perceptive for one so young. There is more to him than meets the eye, that much is certain.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Well, we have come this far\emdash we might as well make our way to this High Hall of theirs and see what he has to say. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I welcome you once again to Angri-La, honoured Luminary. As I believe you know, it is my privilege to serve as High Lama of this most sacred temple. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I am to address you as...Your Holiness, correct? Might I ask what you and your people know of my companion? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Why, everything, of course. We have awaited his coming ever since the day he entered this world, in the castle of Dundrasil. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Waiting for him? What do you mean? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I mean exactly what I say, nothing more. Tell me\emdash do you recognise the symbol on this banner? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell It is the emblem of Dundrasil. Since the Age of Heroes, the princes of that nation have come here to train with us for six years of their youth.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Your young friend was born a prince of Dundrasil. Thus did we expect him to come here as a boy and study under the great Grand Master Pang.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Sadly, that was not to be... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell So if fate had been kinder, you would have spent a good part of your childhood here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell What of his tutor? This...Grand Master Pang you speak of? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell ...When the Lord of Shadows brought the World Tree low, the Master set out to summon a magical mandala to protect the temple from destruction.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The spell succeeded, but its power was too great... Grand Master Pang did not return... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell A noble sacrifice indeed... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Now that the Master is gone, it falls to me to guide you. Come to the Field of Discipline\emdash it lies behind this hall\emdash there is something you must see. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It is a shame that the Grand Master cannot be here. I would have liked to meet one so noble... Come, let us see what His Holiness has in store. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Beyond those doors lies the Field of Discipline, where students of Angri-La strive for enlightenment. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Before we tread upon this hallowed ground, let me tell you a little of our history. And of the Luminary of Legend himself\emdash Erdwin.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Before setting out to defeat the Dark One, Erdwin came to our temple to learn from the wise ones who made their homes here even then.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The first Grand Master, Ai Yi, accepted him as a disciple, and trained him in the secrets of spiritual realisation.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell But he did not train alone. During his time here, he met someone. Someone who would change his fate forever... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Who was this person? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Another of Ai Yi's disciples. A young mage whose talent outshone that of all who had come before. A man named Morcant.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Erdwin and Morcant would train together every day, each striving to outstrip the other. Though they were fierce rivals, they became firm friends.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell When their training was complete, Morcant joined with Erdwin in his quest to slay the Dark One. Without Morcant's magic, he might never have prevailed. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Before setting out, they carved an inscription into this stone. A pledge of eternal friendship. It has been a treasure of ours ever since. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Morcant... I have not heard the name before... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Now, allow me to show you to the Field of Discipline. If you would be so good as to follow me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Welcome to the Field of Discipline. Since the Age of Heroes, many a would-be warrior has spilt sweat and blood upon these flagstones. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell If your karma had been different, this is where you would have trained under Grand Master Pang, like all the princes of Dundrasil before you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I have brought you here so that you might stand in the footsteps of your ancestors\emdash an unbroken line leading all the way back to the Age of Heroes. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Even your grandfather, Lord Robert, completed his training here. The memory of his...achievements...shall live long in the temple's memory... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell His achievements? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Pang was a harsh master. With this implement, disciples whose efforts were lacking were given motivation\emdash directly to their fundament. It became known as...the \lquote Naughty Stick\rquote !\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell During the course of his six years of tuition, your grandfather's right honourable posterior was paddled an unprecedented ten thousand times!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The tale of Lord Robert's road to enlightenment lives on to this day. Every disciple knows that he must focus at all times, lest he face the same fate. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell A legendary achievement indeed... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell You are worried for your grandfather, yes? Do not be. Lord Robert overcame every challenge set for him by the Grand Master, and emerged stronger every time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The fall of the World Tree would not have been enough to extinguish one so resilient. He is alive. I sense it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Tonight, there will be a modest feast in the High Hall to celebrate your long-awaited arrival. We would be greatly honoured if you would join us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell We may not be able to aid you as we would have done were Master Pang still with us, but in this respect at least, we can provide. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell That night, the High Lama holds a banquet in <pc>'s honour.\par
\par
The long-suffering disciples are overjoyed to have an evening's respite from their training, and eat, drink and dance till the early hours.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell Then, morning comes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Awake at last, hm? It is high time we were on our way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell If the Grand Master were still alive, perhaps we might have learned something to help us in our fight against the Lord of Shadows. Sadly, it was not to be... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell ...And the hermit? What news of him? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive us, Your Holiness... The monsters on the mountain path were too strong. We were...unable to reach him... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I see... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Your Holiness\emdash is there a problem? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Yes, Sir Hendrik, I fear there is. You see, two weeks ago a hermit visited us unannounced, then just as suddenly departed for the top of the mountain. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Alone? Whatever for? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell That I do not know. The moment he heard that Master Pang had passed away, he ran from the temple. He was last seen climbing the path to the summit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The mountain has become infested with monsters, emboldened and strengthened by the rise of the Lord of Shadows. It is a perilous place indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell This being so, I dispatched a group of disciples to return him to safety. As you can see, things did not go quite as planned... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have trained all my life for a moment such as this, and yet I have failed in my first true test! I have brought shame upon Angri-La... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Might we be able to offer some assistance? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I thank you for your kindness, but you are guests here. I cannot ask you to undertake such a dangerous task. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell A knight of Heliodor does not abandon an innocent in need. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell These people have shown us great kindness. It is only right that we do them a kindness in return. Would you not agree? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Come now, do not be so churlish. The High Lama needs our help. It would not do to let him down. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Thank you, from the bottom of my heart. But I cannot allow you to bear this burden alone. I shall come with you. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell We must depart for the summit of Mount Pang Lai without delay. After exiting the temple, we will take the path to the east in order to begin our ascent. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Hm. It seems we are too late. Is this the hermit we came in search of? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Unfortunately, so. He was in deep meditation when he breathed his last. I am glad at least that he was prepared to meet his fate.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell But that posture\emdash it is awful. Uniquely awful. I know it from somewhere... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell (gasp) Incredible! Issue One of the Ogler's Digest\emdash and in mint condition!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Uhh... Indeed, it seems our friend here made his peace with the world before departing. This, at least, is some small solace. ...Ahem. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell But this... This is one of the royal treasures of Dundrasil! Why would a lowly hermit have such a...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell By the skies! Can it really be...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Lord Robert! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Your grandfather was Master Pang's most fervent disciple. Can he have chosen to follow his mentor to the next life, perhaps...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell No! He is still breathing! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell What!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell His spirit hovers in the place between life and death. It is only a matter of time before he passes the point of no return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell But there may yet be a way to save him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell If you were to follow him into the void, you might be able to bring him back. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell But...how? Is this even possible? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell The ancient teachings tell us that the summit of Mount Pang Lai stands at the crossroads between this world and the next.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell If you will permit me, I can perform an ancient rite that will send you to the place between worlds.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell But it is not a decision to be taken lightly. Once that place is entered, there is no guarantee of return... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Well? Will you take that chance? Will you visit the void and bring Lord Robert back to us? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell This is no time for indecision. You heard him\emdash your grandfather does not have long left. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell I will ask again. Think carefully before answering. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell Very well. I will prepare for the ritual. Tell me when you are ready, and we will begin. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl High Lama\cell It is time to depart for the place to which every soul must go, but from which few ever return. It is time to perform the rite. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell What is this foolish dance!? What manner of ritual is this? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Another wandering soul drifts into my domain. Welcome, child, to the end of your journey.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Destiny is cruel indeed to send me one so young.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This may be a fruitless question, given the vacant expression you wear, but...do you know what fate awaits you here? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He is wise beyond his years! An intellectual giant! I must return to the world above and tell everyone I met such a marvel!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you think me a fool, boy? Do not pretend. There is no need for pretence here. You are ignorant. This is as it should be.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, you poor young fool! You have no idea of the suffering to come!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Let me unburden you of at least a little of your ignorance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will explain in simple terms that even an idiot may understand. As you see, this world is a blank slate. It is a place of nothingness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before Yggdrasil fell, departed souls would come here before returning to the World Tree.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now that the Tree is gone, it is a place with an entrance but no exit. A dead end for the dead. A spiritual cul-de-sac.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What I am trying to tell you is that you will never leave this world. Before long, your soul will dissipate, and be lost to the void.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As long as the cycle of souls is interrupted, all who die will suffer the same fate. Until at last, the Lord of Shadows is the only one who remains...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is your destiny. Accept it, for you cannot change it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Or do you cling to the vain hope that the Heart of Yggdrasil may be recovered from Mordegon's clutches? If you do, you are a fool.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...And yet, you would not be alone in your foolishness. There are others who refuse to accept that all is lost.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some people just don't know when to give up! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm hm hm! Did you think that he chose death out of a sense of despair? You could not be more wrong.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He came here with hope in his heart. The hope that one day he will defeat the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your grandfather came to find me so that I might teach him the last of my secrets.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know who I am, of course? Foolish child! I am Pang, Grand Master of Angri-La\emdash your grandfather's teacher and tormentor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell Do you see the magic circle that surrounds him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell The precise pattern of movements draws energy from the ether, and channels it to create the mandala of Yggdrasil. This is the final secret.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell He has been flailing away like this ever since he arrived here. It is not good for him at his age.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell But when the great sigil is complete, he will have mastery over a power not seen since the Age of Heroes. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell +$%@&!!! Don't you dare give up now! I'll beat your bottom black and blue, I swear it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hooooooh! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell HNNNGAAAAAAAAAH!!! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell Well, would you look at that. Perhaps he is not completely useless after all... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Did ye see that? I finally did it! Och, it was beautiful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
\pard\intbl Grand Master Pang\cell Hm. Yes, very impressive. I thought you had gone soft in your dotage, but it seems you still have some guts. ...Well done. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10345 
